(5737403, 834683, 40718, '<td valign="top">A contender with DPC tastes.  The title?  I''m not so sure... ;) 8</td>', 'A contender with DPC tastes.  The title?  I''m not so sure... ;) 8', '2009-11-23 00:05:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737406, 835068, 40718, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately your processing, while making the water look cool, really shows up on the cliff to the lower left.</td>', 'Unfortunately your processing, while making the water look cool, really shows up on the cliff to the lower left.', '2009-11-23 00:06:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737407, 834877, 40718, '<td valign="top">Early fav. 9</td>', 'Early fav. 9', '2009-11-23 00:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737408, 835061, 61863, '<td valign="top">Just feels a bit flat, no real subject IMHO</td>', 'Just feels a bit flat, no real subject IMHO', '2009-11-23 00:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737412, 834967, 61863, '<td valign="top">A bit dark perhaps?</td>', 'A bit dark perhaps?', '2009-11-23 00:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737431, 834850, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great use of a vanishing point. I like how the scene is pretty sparse other than the trees right along the road. It''s also interesting how the vanishing point is also the meeting point of lines of trees on either side that presumably mark another road. Nice shot.</td>', 'Great use of a vanishing point. I like how the scene is pretty sparse other than the trees right along the road. It''s also interesting how the vanishing point is also the meeting point of lines of trees on either side that presumably mark another road. Nice shot.', '2009-11-23 00:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737440, 834743, 93565, '<td valign="top">lol<br/>This literally made me lol when I saw it. The title drew me in to see what the hell all the clutter was- and that''s what it was, cluttered crap.<br/>Interesting take on things, and food for thought.</td>', 'lolThis literally made me lol when I saw it. The title drew me in to see what the hell all the clutter was- and that''s what it was, cluttered crap.Interesting take on things, and food for thought.', '2009-11-23 00:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737448, 834928, 93565, '<td valign="top">I''m always a bit of a sucker for photos of this sort, where there are repeating ridges that partially shroud each other. Nice golden hues too.</td>', 'I''m always a bit of a sucker for photos of this sort, where there are repeating ridges that partially shroud each other. Nice golden hues too.', '2009-11-23 00:21:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737449, 834612, 39349, '<td valign="top">This is nothing less than stunning. My only suggestion would be to reduce the borders (top and bottom) by half. Nothing to knock points off for IMHO. Wonderful leading line into the sun through the canyon. The tones complete this shot, brilliant work.</td>', 'This is nothing less than stunning. My only suggestion would be to reduce the borders (top and bottom) by half. Nothing to knock points off for IMHO. Wonderful leading line into the sun through the canyon. The tones complete this shot, brilliant work.', '2009-11-23 00:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737460, 834850, 39349, '<td valign="top">Nice IR shot, like the centered comp. Seems like it could use a bit of B/C to make the center trees pop a bit more, still, very nice work.</td>', 'Nice IR shot, like the centered comp. Seems like it could use a bit of B/C to make the center trees pop a bit more, still, very nice work.', '2009-11-23 00:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737463, 834716, 59267, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!! excellent detail and lighting! a ten from me.</td>', 'Beautiful!! excellent detail and lighting! a ten from me.', '2009-11-23 00:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737465, 834623, 99710, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo but I am not sure if you can categorize this as a "landscape" photo. But I''ll vote for this photo based on its merits.</td>', 'Beautiful photo but I am not sure if you can categorize this as a "landscape" photo. But I''ll vote for this photo based on its merits.', '2009-11-23 00:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
