(5737515, 835130, 104841, '<td valign="top">really good shot. This shot has a real 3D feel with how the mountain stands out from the clouds good job.</td>', 'really good shot. This shot has a real 3D feel with how the mountain stands out from the clouds good job.', '2009-11-23 00:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
