(5737522, 835054, 104841, '<td valign="top">I have some problems with your shot. I don''t like how some of the for ground is unnaturally blue. You lack detail in the trees this may just be because you were shooting into the sun. Also I don''t know what is happening behind those trees. Have a look at some of the other entries to get some ideas on how to improve.</td>', 'I have some problems with your shot. I don''t like how some of the for ground is unnaturally blue. You lack detail in the trees this may just be because you were shooting into the sun. Also I don''t know what is happening behind those trees. Have a look at some of the other entries to get some ideas on how to improve.', '2009-11-23 00:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737529, 834743, 104841, '<td valign="top">I really like the message you are sending with your shot. The right hand side looks a little bit funny to me how the trees just stop so I would have cropped tighter on that side as the sky is so bland.</td>', 'I really like the message you are sending with your shot. The right hand side looks a little bit funny to me how the trees just stop so I would have cropped tighter on that side as the sky is so bland.', '2009-11-23 01:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737532, 834555, 39349, '<td valign="top">Awesome!</td>', 'Awesome!', '2009-11-23 01:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737536, 834882, 39349, '<td valign="top">Oh this is good, really, really good!</td>', 'Oh this is good, really, really good!', '2009-11-23 01:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737538, 834555, 104841, '<td valign="top">bravo for getting up early. Nice shot but I think I might have shot from lower down to try to catch the top of the bridge. I dont know how you got that green dot on the left hand side though.</td>', 'bravo for getting up early. Nice shot but I think I might have shot from lower down to try to catch the top of the bridge. I dont know how you got that green dot on the left hand side though.', '2009-11-23 01:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737543, 834738, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice contrast with the hills. The closest one looks slight over exposed so lacks a bit of detail.</td>', 'nice contrast with the hills. The closest one looks slight over exposed so lacks a bit of detail.', '2009-11-23 01:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737546, 834907, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice reflection. Get down lower to include some more of that bush as right now its not really in the shot, or crop it out.</td>', 'nice reflection. Get down lower to include some more of that bush as right now its not really in the shot, or crop it out.', '2009-11-23 01:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737550, 834996, 104841, '<td valign="top">Nice dramatic shot. I would have tried to remove that sign in the top right as the walkway draws my eye there. Maybe you should have taken the shot at the base of the stairs to avoid that muddy footpath as the stairs are much more interesting, maybe even see some more of the waterfall.</td>', 'Nice dramatic shot. I would have tried to remove that sign in the top right as the walkway draws my eye there. Maybe you should have taken the shot at the base of the stairs to avoid that muddy footpath as the stairs are much more interesting, maybe even see some more of the waterfall.', '2009-11-23 01:18:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737552, 834601, 104841, '<td valign="top">I really love the sky and the nice cool grass. I would have broken off that branch in the top left though.</td>', 'I really love the sky and the nice cool grass. I would have broken off that branch in the top left though.', '2009-11-23 01:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737558, 834612, 37252, '<td valign="top">would have given this a 9, but the border hurts this image</td>', 'would have given this a 9, but the border hurts this image', '2009-11-23 01:30:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737563, 835008, 37252, '<td valign="top">nice shot, but I wish the building on the bottom were not cropped off - seems it would have added even more to this shot.</td>', 'nice shot, but I wish the building on the bottom were not cropped off - seems it would have added even more to this shot.', '2009-11-23 01:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737584, 834994, 104841, '<td valign="top">nice sun rise shot. I would have been tempted to crop out some of the sand at the bottom as its not too interesting well besides your footprints :) Maybe try getting closer to the tree. When you darken your sky you need to try to get as close to the tree as you can otherwise you get that halo effect, try using a soft brush in photoshop or a mask.</td>', 'nice sun rise shot. I would have been tempted to crop out some of the sand at the bottom as its not too interesting well besides your footprints :) Maybe try getting closer to the tree. When you darken your sky you need to try to get as close to the tree as you can otherwise you get that halo effect, try using a soft brush in photoshop or a mask.', '2009-11-23 01:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737598, 835007, 60173, '<td valign="top">Great fairytale colors</td>', 'Great fairytale colors', '2009-11-23 02:02:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737599, 835078, 104841, '<td valign="top">I really like the interesting foreground and the colours. I am going to take a mark off as your horizon is not level, well as far as I can tell</td>', 'I really like the interesting foreground and the colours. I am going to take a mark off as your horizon is not level, well as far as I can tell', '2009-11-23 02:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737600, 834877, 60173, '<td valign="top">What a remarkable location! Lucky you...</td>', 'What a remarkable location! Lucky you...', '2009-11-23 02:03:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737605, 835082, 102386, '<td valign="top">Solid composition, great scenery. Hint of HDR processing, but well handled. I''m not sure about the HDR, which in my opinion is a thumbs up. (no vote)</td>', 'Solid composition, great scenery. Hint of HDR processing, but well handled. I''m not sure about the HDR, which in my opinion is a thumbs up. (no vote)', '2009-11-23 02:09:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737606, 834877, 15511, '<td valign="top">I like this interesting image. The church and some of the buildings appear greenish where I would imagine them to be more gray. Suggest an increase in the mid and and lighter tones in the blue channel to remove some of that yellow...</td>', 'I like this interesting image. The church and some of the buildings appear greenish where I would imagine them to be more gray. Suggest an increase in the mid and and lighter tones in the blue channel to remove some of that yellow...', '2009-11-23 02:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737607, 835044, 15511, '<td valign="top">I think some more contrast in the shadows would increase interest in areas other than the sky.</td>', 'I think some more contrast in the shadows would increase interest in areas other than the sky.', '2009-11-23 02:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737609, 835100, 102386, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and sun rays. For me the dynamic range is pushed a tad far. The cliff face is a little bit bright for it to seem realistic. Many people would disagree with me though, so definitely still a contender. Well done. (no vote)</td>', 'Beautiful composition and sun rays. For me the dynamic range is pushed a tad far. The cliff face is a little bit bright for it to seem realistic. Many people would disagree with me though, so definitely still a contender. Well done. (no vote)', '2009-11-23 02:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737615, 834877, 102386, '<td valign="top">This is superb use of a longer focal length. I cannot fault the composition. Great colours and perfect processing. I am not so sure what the average voter would say, but I really hope this one ends up on the front page! (no vote)</td>', 'This is superb use of a longer focal length. I cannot fault the composition. Great colours and perfect processing. I am not so sure what the average voter would say, but I really hope this one ends up on the front page! (no vote)', '2009-11-23 02:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737617, 834612, 102386, '<td valign="top">This is very good. The sun is well handled. The blown highlights do not over power the scene. Good stuff. (no vote)</td>', 'This is very good. The sun is well handled. The blown highlights do not over power the scene. Good stuff. (no vote)', '2009-11-23 02:18:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5737622, 834965, 15511, '<td valign="top">I''m very pleased by the detail you achieved in all areas of the image.</td>', 'I''m very pleased by the detail you achieved in all areas of the image.', '2009-11-23 02:22:30.000000', NULL, 1),
