(5739141, 835118, 38930, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult to get a good landscape photo in the middle of the day without the sky being blown out.  Perhaps if you had taken this earlier or later in the day it might have turned out a little different.  Nice work tho! :)</td>', 'It''s difficult to get a good landscape photo in the middle of the day without the sky being blown out.  Perhaps if you had taken this earlier or later in the day it might have turned out a little different.  Nice work tho! :)', '2009-11-24 01:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
