(5739949, 834601, 98339, '<td valign="top">I have come back now several times to this...I think that what I am having a problem with is the darkness in the foreground...does the topaz/HDR darken this that much?</td>', 'I have come back now several times to this...I think that what I am having a problem with is the darkness in the foreground...does the topaz/HDR darken this that much?', '2009-11-24 15:13:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739950, 835018, 98339, '<td valign="top">what a pretty sky and different location...</td>', 'what a pretty sky and different location...', '2009-11-24 15:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
