(5739955, 833993, 98339, '<td valign="top">OK...I have come back to this one several times...here are my thoughts...love the reflections...but and I''m not sure....if you did some step photography (move to the left or right) could you have gotten the total reflection of the gazebo in the smooth water with <i><b>NO</b></i> shoreline?  That is where your picture looses it''s appeal...the shoreline.</td>', 'OK...I have come back to this one several times...here are my thoughts...love the reflections...but and I''m not sure....if you did some step photography (move to the left or right) could you have gotten the total reflection of the gazebo in the smooth water with NO shoreline?  That is where your picture looses it''s appeal...the shoreline.', '2009-11-24 15:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739958, 834864, 98339, '<td valign="top">to much haze and not enough sharp clarity for me</td>', 'to much haze and not enough sharp clarity for me', '2009-11-24 15:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5739959, 835119, 98339, '<td valign="top">it seem to me that your horizon is off...I know at the bottom of the picture it seems right...but in the majority of the picture...it seems ka-ka</td>', 'it seem to me that your horizon is off...I know at the bottom of the picture it seems right...but in the majority of the picture...it seems ka-ka', '2009-11-24 15:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
