(5740102, 834838, 60047, '<td valign="top">interesting choice of softness on the rocks. I would have expected a sharper focus. Nice textures.</td>', 'interesting choice of softness on the rocks. I would have expected a sharper focus. Nice textures.', '2009-11-24 16:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
