(5740116, 835068, 60047, '<td valign="top">The colors appear to be almost too boosted - giving the a surreal, neon quality. Beautiful shot &amp; perspective.</td>', 'The colors appear to be almost too boosted - giving the a surreal, neon quality. Beautiful shot & perspective.', '2009-11-24 17:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740119, 835087, 60047, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect regarding your choice of crop. I like the lights in the city - an unusual capture with the sky color.</td>', 'An interesting effect regarding your choice of crop. I like the lights in the city - an unusual capture with the sky color.', '2009-11-24 17:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740121, 835019, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great textures. Too bad the blues were not deeper.</td>', 'Great textures. Too bad the blues were not deeper.', '2009-11-24 17:12:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740128, 835051, 60047, '<td valign="top">Whoa! This is an awesome shot. The clarity is great. But the orange colors are a bit too strong.</td>', 'Whoa! This is an awesome shot. The clarity is great. But the orange colors are a bit too strong.', '2009-11-24 17:23:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740129, 835009, 60047, '<td valign="top">A nice soft and subtle shot.</td>', 'A nice soft and subtle shot.', '2009-11-24 17:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740134, 834978, 60047, '<td valign="top">I like the POV in this shot. Pretty heavy on the water, though.</td>', 'I like the POV in this shot. Pretty heavy on the water, though.', '2009-11-24 17:31:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740135, 835050, 60047, '<td valign="top">Fascinating use of the monochrome blue.</td>', 'Fascinating use of the monochrome blue.', '2009-11-24 17:31:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740136, 834958, 60047, '<td valign="top">This is well balanced. Nice shot.</td>', 'This is well balanced. Nice shot.', '2009-11-24 17:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740137, 835005, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice of the foreground as playing such a prominent role in this shot.</td>', 'Interesting choice of the foreground as playing such a prominent role in this shot.', '2009-11-24 17:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740138, 834543, 60047, '<td valign="top">Gret colors. Nice silhouette work.</td>', 'Gret colors. Nice silhouette work.', '2009-11-24 17:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740139, 835118, 60047, '<td valign="top">Are you shooting into the light on this one? The vines appear to be a bit dark vs the sky.</td>', 'Are you shooting into the light on this one? The vines appear to be a bit dark vs the sky.', '2009-11-24 17:35:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740140, 835074, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great complimentary colors. Great textures.</td>', 'Great complimentary colors. Great textures.', '2009-11-24 17:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740142, 835090, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice rich reds offset by the black.</td>', 'Nice rich reds offset by the black.', '2009-11-24 17:37:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740149, 834851, 60047, '<td valign="top">I like the idea behind this shot - I just wish the object that is in focus was more interesting to look at.</td>', 'I like the idea behind this shot - I just wish the object that is in focus was more interesting to look at.', '2009-11-24 17:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740155, 835014, 60047, '<td valign="top">love the softness and the colors.</td>', 'love the softness and the colors.', '2009-11-24 17:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740161, 834221, 60047, '<td valign="top">Noticeably darkened - a bit too much for my taste. Love the composition. Seems too soft in places.</td>', 'Noticeably darkened - a bit too much for my taste. Love the composition. Seems too soft in places.', '2009-11-24 17:43:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740166, 834684, 60047, '<td valign="top">It almost seems as if the tracks are unnaturally lifting off the ground and into the mist. Otherwise this is a really cool shot.</td>', 'It almost seems as if the tracks are unnaturally lifting off the ground and into the mist. Otherwise this is a really cool shot.', '2009-11-24 17:45:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740170, 835054, 60047, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the blue at the bottom - seems unnatural and steals my view of the rest of the shot.</td>', 'I don''t get the blue at the bottom - seems unnatural and steals my view of the rest of the shot.', '2009-11-24 17:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740176, 834555, 60047, '<td valign="top">A nicely different answer to this challenge.</td>', 'A nicely different answer to this challenge.', '2009-11-24 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740177, 834751, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great water &amp; reflections.</td>', 'Great water & reflections.', '2009-11-24 17:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740179, 834775, 60047, '<td valign="top">Interesting in that this is almost monochrome. Great textures.</td>', 'Interesting in that this is almost monochrome. Great textures.', '2009-11-24 17:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740181, 834864, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great capture. Nice colors. I would have liked even more sharpness and clarity on the buildings.</td>', 'Great capture. Nice colors. I would have liked even more sharpness and clarity on the buildings.', '2009-11-24 17:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740182, 835111, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wonderful pastels on this shot.</td>', 'Wonderful pastels on this shot.', '2009-11-24 17:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740184, 835035, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great primary colors.</td>', 'Great primary colors.', '2009-11-24 17:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740185, 834992, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wonderful. Great greens. Love the fence posts. Nice sky. Well composed.</td>', 'Wonderful. Great greens. Love the fence posts. Nice sky. Well composed.', '2009-11-24 17:53:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740190, 834756, 60047, '<td valign="top">Love the softness of this image. The fact that the tree is centered is just a bit of a distraction for me.</td>', 'Love the softness of this image. The fact that the tree is centered is just a bit of a distraction for me.', '2009-11-24 17:54:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740192, 835095, 60047, '<td valign="top">Nice compositional balance.</td>', 'Nice compositional balance.', '2009-11-24 17:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740193, 835011, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great colors and lines.</td>', 'Great colors and lines.', '2009-11-24 17:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740196, 834891, 60047, '<td valign="top">The sky is almost too richly blue. Wonderful contrast to the deep green of the grass.</td>', 'The sky is almost too richly blue. Wonderful contrast to the deep green of the grass.', '2009-11-24 17:56:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740203, 834876, 60047, '<td valign="top">Great textures and colors. Nice use of the fog.</td>', 'Great textures and colors. Nice use of the fog.', '2009-11-24 17:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740249, 834854, 16488, '<td valign="top">What drama! Love the sky but the foreground exposure is a bit to high...I think the dead white space in the snow on the left is a detractor.</td>', 'What drama! Love the sky but the foreground exposure is a bit to high...I think the dead white space in the snow on the left is a detractor.', '2009-11-24 18:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740250, 835001, 16488, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition! I like the repetition of horizontal lines from sky to field.</td>', 'Lovely composition! I like the repetition of horizontal lines from sky to field.', '2009-11-24 18:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740252, 835014, 16488, '<td valign="top">What a pleasant desolation! Cyans are pretty and nicely complemented by the ruddy rocks.</td>', 'What a pleasant desolation! Cyans are pretty and nicely complemented by the ruddy rocks.', '2009-11-24 18:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740253, 834633, 16488, '<td valign="top">The god-sky helps put things in perspective. Pleasant toning. Hope this is doing well in the competition.</td>', 'The god-sky helps put things in perspective. Pleasant toning. Hope this is doing well in the competition.', '2009-11-24 18:55:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740255, 834377, 16488, '<td valign="top">All this needs is a gator to poke it''s head up! It looks just like a postcard! ...and it is the processing that makes it so. Well used. I would point out that the lower right hand corner is its weakness. If only that triangle of water were gone and the bright green grass as well. Nonetheless, fun to view.</td>', 'All this needs is a gator to poke it''s head up! It looks just like a postcard! ...and it is the processing that makes it so. Well used. I would point out that the lower right hand corner is its weakness. If only that triangle of water were gone and the bright green grass as well. Nonetheless, fun to view.', '2009-11-24 18:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740256, 834125, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice color! I like the pampas grasses in the foreground. Title doesn''t really say it given the drama in the sky but I''ll forgive you.</td>', 'Nice color! I like the pampas grasses in the foreground. Title doesn''t really say it given the drama in the sky but I''ll forgive you.', '2009-11-24 18:59:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740257, 834739, 16488, '<td valign="top">Sweet! The composition is very pleasing. The arc of the branches echoed by the shadow. Well-handled greens in the grass. Jiggies and jaggies of grasses and trees. All good!</td>', 'Sweet! The composition is very pleasing. The arc of the branches echoed by the shadow. Well-handled greens in the grass. Jiggies and jaggies of grasses and trees. All good!', '2009-11-24 19:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740259, 834612, 16488, '<td valign="top">Taking no chances on the 800 pixel thing? ;-)<br/>Beautifully detailed image with all things in the right places and (other than the heavy black borders) nothing there that shouldn''t be there.<br/>I''m guessing that when the competition is over the sky won''t be the only thing that''s blue.</td>', 'Taking no chances on the 800 pixel thing? ;-)Beautifully detailed image with all things in the right places and (other than the heavy black borders) nothing there that shouldn''t be there.I''m guessing that when the competition is over the sky won''t be the only thing that''s blue.', '2009-11-24 19:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(5740260, 835107, 16488, '<td valign="top">That sunlight is a bit blown and empty...but you''re getting a high vote from me for making the grass the best it could possibly be.</td>', 'That sunlight is a bit blown and empty...but you''re getting a high vote from me for making the grass the best it could possibly be.', '2009-11-24 19:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
