(5740321, 835101, 60047, '<td valign="top">I think that the windshield-as-watercolor isn''t quite working for me.I find myself wanting to see the image without the windshield in the way.. I love the composition of the shot.</td>', 'I think that the windshield-as-watercolor isn''t quite working for me.I find myself wanting to see the image without the windshield in the way.. I love the composition of the shot.', '2009-11-24 19:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
