(5740551, 834434, 60047, '<td valign="top">I love the drama of the plunging slope of the ridge across the water. Nicely done with such difficult light.</td>', 'I love the drama of the plunging slope of the ridge across the water. Nicely done with such difficult light.', '2009-11-24 22:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
