(5740553, 834190, 60047, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully crisp and wintery. The tree''s out of focus parts lends it an almost surreal appeal.</td>', 'Wonderfully crisp and wintery. The tree''s out of focus parts lends it an almost surreal appeal.', '2009-11-24 22:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
