(5743331, 835021, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure I consider this to be a landscape. The line is certainly a fuzzy one and highly debatable, however. Nonetheless, a nice sharp wideangle view.</td>', 'Not quite sure I consider this to be a landscape. The line is certainly a fuzzy one and highly debatable, however. Nonetheless, a nice sharp wideangle view.', '2009-11-26 23:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
