(5743373, 834864, 96614, '<td valign="top">This would be a much nicer image if there was some detail in the lower part of the image... all the trees there are showing up black... i know it''s out of your control, but without that black area the image would be much nicer</td>', 'This would be a much nicer image if there was some detail in the lower part of the image... all the trees there are showing up black... i know it''s out of your control, but without that black area the image would be much nicer', '2009-11-27 00:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743374, 834609, 96614, '<td valign="top">Amazing clouds/fog, but it looks like the horizon is not leveled on the bottom, which is distracting, but great shot!</td>', 'Amazing clouds/fog, but it looks like the horizon is not leveled on the bottom, which is distracting, but great shot!', '2009-11-27 00:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743376, 835008, 96614, '<td valign="top">the crop is too tight on the bottom... tip the camera down more next time so that part of the house isn''t cut off, but great shot!</td>', 'the crop is too tight on the bottom... tip the camera down more next time so that part of the house isn''t cut off, but great shot!', '2009-11-27 00:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743377, 835107, 96614, '<td valign="top">You have framed this VERY nicely, but it looks overprocessed</td>', 'You have framed this VERY nicely, but it looks overprocessed', '2009-11-27 00:14:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743379, 833993, 96614, '<td valign="top">Awesome Reflection!!!</td>', 'Awesome Reflection!!!', '2009-11-27 00:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743381, 835059, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice shot!!!  Is this from the USA side?  I''m on the Canada side and haven''t been there since about 2 years ago when I got into photography... I will definately be going there soon! thanks for the inspiration!   (10)</td>', 'Nice shot!!!  Is this from the USA side?  I''m on the Canada side and haven''t been there since about 2 years ago when I got into photography... I will definately be going there soon! thanks for the inspiration!   (10)', '2009-11-27 00:21:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743383, 834765, 96614, '<td valign="top">Nice deep DOF!!!</td>', 'Nice deep DOF!!!', '2009-11-27 00:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743386, 835088, 99710, '<td valign="top">Decent photo, but the position of the structure being almost centered puts me off.</td>', 'Decent photo, but the position of the structure being almost centered puts me off.', '2009-11-27 00:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743391, 834750, 99710, '<td valign="top">The problem with doing a long-exposure photo over a port area is that the yacht/barge/ships moves and our eyes can''t often see that, proof is this photo. Without the yacht, this photo is good.</td>', 'The problem with doing a long-exposure photo over a port area is that the yacht/barge/ships moves and our eyes can''t often see that, proof is this photo. Without the yacht, this photo is good.', '2009-11-27 00:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743392, 835092, 99710, '<td valign="top">The horizons puts me off. Though I commend you for the effort.</td>', 'The horizons puts me off. Though I commend you for the effort.', '2009-11-27 00:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743393, 834882, 99710, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand the effect in respect to the challenge.</td>', 'I don''t understand the effect in respect to the challenge.', '2009-11-27 00:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743394, 835118, 99710, '<td valign="top">a big no in composition for the bald and over-exposed sky.</td>', 'a big no in composition for the bald and over-exposed sky.', '2009-11-27 00:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743405, 835019, 29011, '<td valign="top">The HDR/Tonemapping effect works really well for this shot. Really brings out those textures. Nicely done there. No halos which is nice. Only nitpick about the PP is that I don''t particular like the vignetting on the left. It seems to be a bit out of place.</td>', 'The HDR/Tonemapping effect works really well for this shot. Really brings out those textures. Nicely done there. No halos which is nice. Only nitpick about the PP is that I don''t particular like the vignetting on the left. It seems to be a bit out of place.', '2009-11-27 00:54:57.000000', NULL, 1),
