(5743508, 834877, 25355, '<td valign="top">All along, down along, out along lee.<br/> <br/>Great afternoon lighting, nice and sharp.<br/> <br/>Is this temba''s?<br/>I went with my family to Widecombe Fair in 1970, hence the quote from the famous song. ;-)</td>', 'All along, down along, out along lee. Great afternoon lighting, nice and sharp. Is this temba''s?I went with my family to Widecombe Fair in 1970, hence the quote from the famous song. ;-)', '2009-11-27 07:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743528, 834992, 5364, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful landscape. I''ll have to start exploring Exmoor.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful landscape. I''ll have to start exploring Exmoor.', '2009-11-27 08:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743530, 835000, 5364, '<td valign="top">An interesting picture, but I find the foreground grass has too much emphasis and is therefore distracting</td>', 'An interesting picture, but I find the foreground grass has too much emphasis and is therefore distracting', '2009-11-27 08:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743531, 834851, 5364, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I feel the bright reflection from the water on the path is a bit distracting and those people obviously having a conversation rather contradict the silence in your title.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I feel the bright reflection from the water on the path is a bit distracting and those people obviously having a conversation rather contradict the silence in your title.', '2009-11-27 08:29:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743533, 834566, 5364, '<td valign="top">Nice choice with the water and colours, but the horizontal composition isn''t the most inspiring to me, and the border isn''t helping. I''d be interested to see if you got a picture with the river flowing more diagonally across the frame.</td>', 'Nice choice with the water and colours, but the horizontal composition isn''t the most inspiring to me, and the border isn''t helping. I''d be interested to see if you got a picture with the river flowing more diagonally across the frame.', '2009-11-27 08:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
