(5743774, 834732, 44611, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice to do this in b &amp; w although it really shows the light and shadow contrasts beautifully.</td>', 'Interesting choice to do this in b & w although it really shows the light and shadow contrasts beautifully.', '2009-11-27 12:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
