(5743817, 834971, 44611, '<td valign="top">Superb waterfall shot.  You''re shutter speed was spot on, the water is beautiful and I love the autumn colours.</td>', 'Superb waterfall shot.  You''re shutter speed was spot on, the water is beautiful and I love the autumn colours.', '2009-11-27 12:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
