(5743875, 835044, 83313, '<td valign="top">Contrast seems too little flat to knock ''em dead on this site, though I suspect you were trying to channel the spirit of Ansel Adams. It''s still a pleasing view.</td>', 'Contrast seems too little flat to knock ''em dead on this site, though I suspect you were trying to channel the spirit of Ansel Adams. It''s still a pleasing view.', '2009-11-27 14:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743881, 835125, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure there is a tree or even a speck of soil in this scene. (OK, I finally spotted a limb off to the far right edge). I know such a scene can sometimes fit into the definition of landscape, however it''s just not fitting what I consider to be a landscape. Sorry.</td>', 'I''m not sure there is a tree or even a speck of soil in this scene. (OK, I finally spotted a limb off to the far right edge). I know such a scene can sometimes fit into the definition of landscape, however it''s just not fitting what I consider to be a landscape. Sorry.', '2009-11-27 14:10:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743884, 834970, 83313, '<td valign="top">Some serious banding is visible in the sky. It''s something I also have a difficult time keeping under control.</td>', 'Some serious banding is visible in the sky. It''s something I also have a difficult time keeping under control.', '2009-11-27 14:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743888, 834190, 83313, '<td valign="top">The slight blurriness around the peripheral limbs of the trees suggest this may be an HDR merge. I like the effect.</td>', 'The slight blurriness around the peripheral limbs of the trees suggest this may be an HDR merge. I like the effect.', '2009-11-27 14:15:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5743895, 834648, 83313, '<td valign="top">You know, I''ve seen several versions of it and it still makes no sense to me. I may just have to read the stinkin'' book one of these days. The sand worms are pretty darn cool, however.</td>', 'You know, I''ve seen several versions of it and it still makes no sense to me. I may just have to read the stinkin'' book one of these days. The sand worms are pretty darn cool, however.', '2009-11-27 14:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
