(5744036, 835002, 83313, '<td valign="top">Comes off to me as a bit overprocessed. Perhaps reducing the saturation of the yellow channel could give it a more realistic look. I''ve found yellow is a major component of foliage greens and I often have to pull it down a bit.</td>', 'Comes off to me as a bit overprocessed. Perhaps reducing the saturation of the yellow channel could give it a more realistic look. I''ve found yellow is a major component of foliage greens and I often have to pull it down a bit.', '2009-11-27 17:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744039, 834751, 83313, '<td valign="top">A bit grainy and I see some artifacts around the limbs. My suspicion is this that some of this may be the result of trying to pull the detail from a backlit JPEG exposure. I''d be curious to see the out of the camera shot.  In spite of that major problem, I find it a pleasing scene.</td>', 'A bit grainy and I see some artifacts around the limbs. My suspicion is this that some of this may be the result of trying to pull the detail from a backlit JPEG exposure. I''d be curious to see the out of the camera shot.  In spite of that major problem, I find it a pleasing scene.', '2009-11-27 17:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744044, 834221, 36981, '<td valign="top">I love this mood and the tones.  There''s something about the swan (or goose?) that''s bothering me - it looks jagged or something, when everything else is so smooth.  Overall, a really great image.</td>', 'I love this mood and the tones.  There''s something about the swan (or goose?) that''s bothering me - it looks jagged or something, when everything else is so smooth.  Overall, a really great image.', '2009-11-27 17:31:12.000000', NULL, 1),
