(5744165, 835059, 111808, '<td valign="top">Thundering natural power of this immense waterfall and you have captured it beautifully with the silken flow. The white and grey tones of the water contrast nicely with the left hand bits of brush and stone. The shapes and tones of the water are repeated in the sky and clouds. This is flowing free broken up only by the landshore in the middle to provide anchor. Excellent, one of my very favourites. The encapsulation of controlled force is magnificent.</td>', 'Thundering natural power of this immense waterfall and you have captured it beautifully with the silken flow. The white and grey tones of the water contrast nicely with the left hand bits of brush and stone. The shapes and tones of the water are repeated in the sky and clouds. This is flowing free broken up only by the landshore in the middle to provide anchor. Excellent, one of my very favourites. The encapsulation of controlled force is magnificent.', '2009-11-27 19:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744175, 835014, 28532, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Very peaceful and serene.</td>', 'Lovely! Very peaceful and serene.', '2009-11-27 19:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744176, 833993, 28532, '<td valign="top">Love the reflection.  Gorgeous!</td>', 'Love the reflection.  Gorgeous!', '2009-11-27 19:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744177, 834998, 111808, '<td valign="top">The tones of wilderness Earth and aged stones match the old barn in textures and weathering. This is so wide, taking in such an expanse of land and an extensive if troubled skyscape. The one structure then calls back the eye, anchoring it firmly and the peaked shapes of the only manmade structure are echoed by the hills in back. Rustic, remote,beautiful.</td>', 'The tones of wilderness Earth and aged stones match the old barn in textures and weathering. This is so wide, taking in such an expanse of land and an extensive if troubled skyscape. The one structure then calls back the eye, anchoring it firmly and the peaked shapes of the only manmade structure are echoed by the hills in back. Rustic, remote,beautiful.', '2009-11-27 19:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744184, 834683, 28532, '<td valign="top">Yeah.... this is just spectacular!  I would love to have been there in person to see such a breathtaking view.  It does look yummy!</td>', 'Yeah.... this is just spectacular!  I would love to have been there in person to see such a breathtaking view.  It does look yummy!', '2009-11-27 19:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744185, 835019, 28532, '<td valign="top">I am surrounded by corn and have never seen it this beautiful!  Nicely captured!</td>', 'I am surrounded by corn and have never seen it this beautiful!  Nicely captured!', '2009-11-27 19:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744187, 835078, 28532, '<td valign="top">The colors are simply amazing! Stunning image!</td>', 'The colors are simply amazing! Stunning image!', '2009-11-27 19:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744190, 834927, 111808, '<td valign="top">This is a photograph of repeating patterns - the incoming tide patterns match the multiple sand patterns of the oft previous tides. Those patterns in turn have a corresponding match and echo in the textures and patterns of the illuminated cliffs. I find this peaceful in its eternal continuity.</td>', 'This is a photograph of repeating patterns - the incoming tide patterns match the multiple sand patterns of the oft previous tides. Those patterns in turn have a corresponding match and echo in the textures and patterns of the illuminated cliffs. I find this peaceful in its eternal continuity.', '2009-11-27 19:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744194, 834876, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like how the rich brown earth lines and tones in this fade slowly and quietly into a softer representation of being. Then Fog changes this landscape into more muted tones, more indistinct, less definable, into hills that roll and blend with sky. Be aware of near and far will take care of itself, worry not in the natural order of things.</td>', 'I like how the rich brown earth lines and tones in this fade slowly and quietly into a softer representation of being. Then Fog changes this landscape into more muted tones, more indistinct, less definable, into hills that roll and blend with sky. Be aware of near and far will take care of itself, worry not in the natural order of things.', '2009-11-27 20:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744198, 834928, 111808, '<td valign="top">Slowly the sun arises and touches the first of the hills, then moves on to light the next, and the next. The repeating waves of hills in this make this photograph serene and beautiful. Change comes slowly but it brings the Light, and the Darkness will recede. It has always been so in the order of things.</td>', 'Slowly the sun arises and touches the first of the hills, then moves on to light the next, and the next. The repeating waves of hills in this make this photograph serene and beautiful. Change comes slowly but it brings the Light, and the Darkness will recede. It has always been so in the order of things.', '2009-11-27 20:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744199, 835083, 25355, '<td valign="top">A bit of camera movement there. Don''t you have Image Stabilisation? ;-Þ</td>', 'A bit of camera movement there. Don''t you have Image Stabilisation? ;-Þ', '2009-11-27 20:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744204, 835129, 111808, '<td valign="top">The patterns of the curved treeline in this give way to the related patterns of both the flowing and frozen waters which is in turn reinforced by the curvatures and slopes of the snowy land with its grassy stubble which is related to the trees which began this rich visual journey. Winter is indeed coming, be thee prepared, for it is savage and unforgiving, cold and patient. I like how the footsteps in the snow both blend in and end independently.</td>', 'The patterns of the curved treeline in this give way to the related patterns of both the flowing and frozen waters which is in turn reinforced by the curvatures and slopes of the snowy land with its grassy stubble which is related to the trees which began this rich visual journey. Winter is indeed coming, be thee prepared, for it is savage and unforgiving, cold and patient. I like how the footsteps in the snow both blend in and end independently.', '2009-11-27 20:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744207, 834612, 90414, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image - my favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful image - my favorite in the challenge.', '2009-11-27 20:29:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744208, 834996, 90414, '<td valign="top">Amazing and beautiful image.</td>', 'Amazing and beautiful image.', '2009-11-27 20:30:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744209, 835118, 111808, '<td valign="top">It is the vertical and horizontal, sometimes intersecting, sometimes repeating lines that make this dynamically moving photograph effective.It is Autumn,and in this season of change the vines are slowly dying, and the sky is white in melancholy mourning.</td>', 'It is the vertical and horizontal, sometimes intersecting, sometimes repeating lines that make this dynamically moving photograph effective.It is Autumn,and in this season of change the vines are slowly dying, and the sky is white in melancholy mourning.', '2009-11-27 20:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744210, 834721, 111808, '<td valign="top">The tones of dark and light in this are stunningly beautiful. The layers of repeating Earth enfolds the clouds, highlighted by the crepuscular rays of the brilliant white sun. Awakening the day, awakening the soul as well. Kudos, well done.</td>', 'The tones of dark and light in this are stunningly beautiful. The layers of repeating Earth enfolds the clouds, highlighted by the crepuscular rays of the brilliant white sun. Awakening the day, awakening the soul as well. Kudos, well done.', '2009-11-27 20:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744215, 834312, 111808, '<td valign="top">How beautiful this is with the colours of the brilliant, tousled orange tree, the golds in the grass, the greens not yet changed in the background. The sturdy latticework of the wonderfully curved bridge creates a counterpoint of stability which Autumn is slowly encroaching on. This is a favourite for its dynamic movement and blendings.</td>', 'How beautiful this is with the colours of the brilliant, tousled orange tree, the golds in the grass, the greens not yet changed in the background. The sturdy latticework of the wonderfully curved bridge creates a counterpoint of stability which Autumn is slowly encroaching on. This is a favourite for its dynamic movement and blendings.', '2009-11-27 20:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744219, 835019, 111808, '<td valign="top">Beautiful textures in this Autumn cornfield and how reassuring to know that something has matured and grown out of that long ago September battlefield. Now it is once again the Season of Change and Dying, perhaps in a distant echo of the past. This place is now serene, anticipating a different future.<br/>The stalks will stand true. Are there 3,654 of them which remember?</td>', 'Beautiful textures in this Autumn cornfield and how reassuring to know that something has matured and grown out of that long ago September battlefield. Now it is once again the Season of Change and Dying, perhaps in a distant echo of the past. This place is now serene, anticipating a different future.The stalks will stand true. Are there 3,654 of them which remember?', '2009-11-27 20:55:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744220, 834683, 111808, '<td valign="top">This seascape is beautiful and serene with the soft flowing waves. The rich reddish colour of the light on the rocks, the tumbledown sky over the darker cliffs and the sweep of the blue combine to make this outstanding. Kudos, superb capture.</td>', 'This seascape is beautiful and serene with the soft flowing waves. The rich reddish colour of the light on the rocks, the tumbledown sky over the darker cliffs and the sweep of the blue combine to make this outstanding. Kudos, superb capture.', '2009-11-27 21:01:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744222, 835084, 111808, '<td valign="top">Nice panoramic. The colours and textures and patterns of the clouds immediately catch the eye and create a sense of dynamic tension and quick movement. After studying them for awhile, then the jutting grey hills and peaks come into focus and only lastly the scrubby foreland of this vast Arizona landscape. Wide, balanced, evocative of desolation and wilderness.</td>', 'Nice panoramic. The colours and textures and patterns of the clouds immediately catch the eye and create a sense of dynamic tension and quick movement. After studying them for awhile, then the jutting grey hills and peaks come into focus and only lastly the scrubby foreland of this vast Arizona landscape. Wide, balanced, evocative of desolation and wilderness.', '2009-11-27 21:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744224, 835005, 111808, '<td valign="top">Love the interplay of light and colour on sky and peaks reflecting in the waters and land. Superb pastel tones and repeating lines. The violet blue in the foreground matches the sky and the patches of wet beach almost look like stepping stones on a path to serenity. Outstanding photograph.</td>', 'Love the interplay of light and colour on sky and peaks reflecting in the waters and land. Superb pastel tones and repeating lines. The violet blue in the foreground matches the sky and the patches of wet beach almost look like stepping stones on a path to serenity. Outstanding photograph.', '2009-11-27 21:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744227, 834648, 111808, '<td valign="top">I like the rippled wind patterns in the sand and the wide expanse. The sky is menacing, dark with cloud swirls, great contrast to the mostly warm golden tones and shades of the desert.</td>', 'I like the rippled wind patterns in the sand and the wide expanse. The sky is menacing, dark with cloud swirls, great contrast to the mostly warm golden tones and shades of the desert.', '2009-11-27 21:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744236, 835074, 111808, '<td valign="top">This offering is beautiful. I like the contrast between the rocks on the beach and the larger stone outcropping jutting out straight and massive into the sea. I love the multiple tones of ocean, golden to serene blue and how the sky recaptures them. I love the gentle lapping movement of peaceful flowing water.</td>', 'This offering is beautiful. I like the contrast between the rocks on the beach and the larger stone outcropping jutting out straight and massive into the sea. I love the multiple tones of ocean, golden to serene blue and how the sky recaptures them. I love the gentle lapping movement of peaceful flowing water.', '2009-11-27 21:31:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744241, 834676, 7810, '<td valign="top">I hope this does well ... I love the graphic of this natural scene. The diagonals, the parallel lines the various shades of blue. This is awesome (faved)</td>', 'I hope this does well ... I love the graphic of this natural scene. The diagonals, the parallel lines the various shades of blue. This is awesome (faved)', '2009-11-27 21:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744243, 834996, 111808, '<td valign="top">What a delightful blending of texture and colours in this beautifully balanced whole. The movement in the water, anchored by a single tree which leads the view to the Falls. The rough hewn stone wall, whose line leads the view to the old steep stone stairs and up into the Autumn tinged hillside offset by the towering cliffs on the left with their green crown of firs reaching down again to the water. This is superb, one of my definite favourites. I would love to walk this path and be renewed in spirit with this place.</td>', 'What a delightful blending of texture and colours in this beautifully balanced whole. The movement in the water, anchored by a single tree which leads the view to the Falls. The rough hewn stone wall, whose line leads the view to the old steep stone stairs and up into the Autumn tinged hillside offset by the towering cliffs on the left with their green crown of firs reaching down again to the water. This is superb, one of my definite favourites. I would love to walk this path and be renewed in spirit with this place.', '2009-11-27 21:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744248, 835100, 111808, '<td valign="top">The elements in this peaceful scene are superb. I like the light rays emanating from the singular cloud and reflecting back again on the still, wet beach and the morning ocean waves are small, quiet and serene, barely lapping. These are reflected again in the lines of the cliffs, opposites in nature and yet echoes of each other''s shapes. I like the slopes and patterns of this photograph and the cerulean patch of sky. This day promises to be a good one, indeed.</td>', 'The elements in this peaceful scene are superb. I like the light rays emanating from the singular cloud and reflecting back again on the still, wet beach and the morning ocean waves are small, quiet and serene, barely lapping. These are reflected again in the lines of the cliffs, opposites in nature and yet echoes of each other''s shapes. I like the slopes and patterns of this photograph and the cerulean patch of sky. This day promises to be a good one, indeed.', '2009-11-27 21:57:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744252, 834566, 111808, '<td valign="top">How swift and cold the Autumn waters, gurgling over and around the wellworn raggedy rocks. This is gorgeous and the colours of the trees on the land contrast so well with it, snapping it out into crisp focus. The movement of the cascading water is wild and primal, rushing downwards out of the frame never breaking the flow or balance. Superb capture, one of my favourites.</td>', 'How swift and cold the Autumn waters, gurgling over and around the wellworn raggedy rocks. This is gorgeous and the colours of the trees on the land contrast so well with it, snapping it out into crisp focus. The movement of the cascading water is wild and primal, rushing downwards out of the frame never breaking the flow or balance. Superb capture, one of my favourites.', '2009-11-27 22:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744257, 834716, 111808, '<td valign="top">Our souls have sight, which brought us hither, to look upon this serene and beautiful photograph, with wave''s crash rolling in that we might pause, and hear the mighty waters rolling evermore. Superb seascape, colours of slate greens and blues, smooth and churning, contrasting with the sharp jutting rocks. The Sea keeps her own secrets but you have captured them well.</td>', 'Our souls have sight, which brought us hither, to look upon this serene and beautiful photograph, with wave''s crash rolling in that we might pause, and hear the mighty waters rolling evermore. Superb seascape, colours of slate greens and blues, smooth and churning, contrasting with the sharp jutting rocks. The Sea keeps her own secrets but you have captured them well.', '2009-11-27 22:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744260, 834684, 111808, '<td valign="top">And so where does this Road go? Forward, then fading, forlorn in its black and white starkness. I cannot see the end and yet I want to travel it. I could not say that, were it not for you. Unique and powerful photograph.</td>', 'And so where does this Road go? Forward, then fading, forlorn in its black and white starkness. I cannot see the end and yet I want to travel it. I could not say that, were it not for you. Unique and powerful photograph.', '2009-11-27 22:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744261, 835094, 53814, '<td valign="top">Of course, if DPC were a juried competition this would be a ribbon winner. Probably a blue. I need higher resolution to make out the features of the creature struggling to emerge from the primordial soup. I swear I see two arms (one with two fingers, one with a thumb) and maybe a head. The unexpected man-made object on the lower left adds to the debate over where, in the universe, this tortured planet was photographed. Brilliant work.</td>', 'Of course, if DPC were a juried competition this would be a ribbon winner. Probably a blue. I need higher resolution to make out the features of the creature struggling to emerge from the primordial soup. I swear I see two arms (one with two fingers, one with a thumb) and maybe a head. The unexpected man-made object on the lower left adds to the debate over where, in the universe, this tortured planet was photographed. Brilliant work.', '2009-11-27 22:39:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744270, 834732, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is very nice in many ways. Lovely conversion. To my eye you''ve gone a bit too far with the shadow/highlight. tone mapping, or whatever, to where the shadows on the ground are unnaturally bright, and this keeps me from giving a very high score, but still I love the overall mood. 7 from me.</td>', 'This is very nice in many ways. Lovely conversion. To my eye you''ve gone a bit too far with the shadow/highlight. tone mapping, or whatever, to where the shadows on the ground are unnaturally bright, and this keeps me from giving a very high score, but still I love the overall mood. 7 from me.', '2009-11-27 22:56:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744274, 834996, 30861, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one. It has an unusual power to it. I have a sense of "not liking" it bcause the walkway and top of the wall seem too bright for the scene (I think that''s what I''m reacting too, but I''m not sure), but at the same time there''s an overalls ense of etched tonality that is compelling me.<br/> <br/>It may just be that I feel like it''s divided too neatly into equal wedges, I donno.<br/> <br/>Anyway, I''m bumping from 7 to 8 now :-) For me, 8''s a very high score, especially on a landscape.</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one. It has an unusual power to it. I have a sense of "not liking" it bcause the walkway and top of the wall seem too bright for the scene (I think that''s what I''m reacting too, but I''m not sure), but at the same time there''s an overalls ense of etched tonality that is compelling me. It may just be that I feel like it''s divided too neatly into equal wedges, I donno. Anyway, I''m bumping from 7 to 8 now :-) For me, 8''s a very high score, especially on a landscape.', '2009-11-27 22:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744277, 834221, 30861, '<td valign="top">Outstanding, primitive and compelling in equal measure. 10</td>', 'Outstanding, primitive and compelling in equal measure. 10', '2009-11-27 23:02:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744278, 834676, 111808, '<td valign="top">The different colours of blue in the five overlapping hills and the additional shades of the sky combine to make this monochromatic themed photograph quite beautiful and equally masterful in its deliberate simplicity. Kudos, well done.</td>', 'The different colours of blue in the five overlapping hills and the additional shades of the sky combine to make this monochromatic themed photograph quite beautiful and equally masterful in its deliberate simplicity. Kudos, well done.', '2009-11-27 23:03:23.000000', NULL, 1),
