(5744531, 835077, 76598, '<td valign="top">IMO, images like this work better on a cloudy day or when the sun catches an individual cloud.  The part you want people to view the most is the darkest part of the image.</td>', 'IMO, images like this work better on a cloudy day or when the sun catches an individual cloud.  The part you want people to view the most is the darkest part of the image.', '2009-11-28 09:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744533, 834612, 76598, '<td valign="top">I really like how the sun plays across the image and the rays are really nice.  I am not so enthralled with the black bars told and bottom.</td>', 'I really like how the sun plays across the image and the rays are really nice.  I am not so enthralled with the black bars told and bottom.', '2009-11-28 09:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744534, 835044, 76598, '<td valign="top">black and white?  The image strikes me as being "flat"</td>', 'black and white?  The image strikes me as being "flat"', '2009-11-28 09:19:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744536, 834967, 76598, '<td valign="top">Really interesting location, the image strikes me as being under exposed.</td>', 'Really interesting location, the image strikes me as being under exposed.', '2009-11-28 09:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744556, 834312, 106349, '<td valign="top">Nice range of colors.</td>', 'Nice range of colors.', '2009-11-28 10:06:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744560, 834684, 35804, '<td valign="top">Ooooooo...very nice! I love how the land disappears into nothingness.</td>', 'Ooooooo...very nice! I love how the land disappears into nothingness.', '2009-11-28 10:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744563, 835050, 35804, '<td valign="top">The deep Prussian blues appeal to me...the colors of twilight, between <i>here</i> and <i>there</i>, what is and what isn''t...this has an atmosphere that is felt, and a place that may exist in my own mind...very nice.</td>', 'The deep Prussian blues appeal to me...the colors of twilight, between here and there, what is and what isn''t...this has an atmosphere that is felt, and a place that may exist in my own mind...very nice.', '2009-11-28 10:20:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744566, 834743, 35804, '<td valign="top">A modern landscape...this photograph just proves that there are pictures everywhere, <i>beautiful</i> pictures everywhere. Yes, it''s garbage, but it''s the light that lends the appeal. And the crescendo of the treeline is a nice accent. A welcome break from ultraviolet skies and crunchy grass.</td>', 'A modern landscape...this photograph just proves that there are pictures everywhere, beautiful pictures everywhere. Yes, it''s garbage, but it''s the light that lends the appeal. And the crescendo of the treeline is a nice accent. A welcome break from ultraviolet skies and crunchy grass.', '2009-11-28 10:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744572, 835001, 62187, '<td valign="top">A sweet photo with what to me is more focused on the barn and farm then ''Landscape''. However, I think it still deserves a 9 even though it''s a 10 of a photo.</td>', 'A sweet photo with what to me is more focused on the barn and farm then ''Landscape''. However, I think it still deserves a 9 even though it''s a 10 of a photo.', '2009-11-28 10:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744573, 834928, 62187, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of where I had my best vacation ever: Bristol, Tennessee. But, it''s probably not. Anyway, the photo is awesome to me. A great Landscape. 10</td>', 'This reminds me of where I had my best vacation ever: Bristol, Tennessee. But, it''s probably not. Anyway, the photo is awesome to me. A great Landscape. 10', '2009-11-28 10:42:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744577, 834894, 62187, '<td valign="top">It''s an excellent photo for sure. I feel the subject matter is more focused on the Tree rather then the ''Landscape''. Still, I think it deserves at least a 9.</td>', 'It''s an excellent photo for sure. I feel the subject matter is more focused on the Tree rather then the ''Landscape''. Still, I think it deserves at least a 9.', '2009-11-28 10:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744578, 835107, 62187, '<td valign="top">An excellently composed photo and excellent use of surrounding environment: 10.</td>', 'An excellently composed photo and excellent use of surrounding environment: 10.', '2009-11-28 10:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5744580, 834648, 62187, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to get on my ATV and make some tracks! Not really, it''s beautiful like this. Those clouds are trophy! 10</td>', 'This makes me want to get on my ATV and make some tracks! Not really, it''s beautiful like this. Those clouds are trophy! 10', '2009-11-28 10:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
