(5744942, 835082, 62187, '<td valign="top">A great photograph. I''m weird but to me, what keeps it from being an absolute 10 is the beautiful tree which draws my eye away from the landscape. The photo is a 10 but for the challenge I''ll score it an 8.</td>', 'A great photograph. I''m weird but to me, what keeps it from being an absolute 10 is the beautiful tree which draws my eye away from the landscape. The photo is a 10 but for the challenge I''ll score it an 8.', '2009-11-28 21:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
