(5746013, 833993, 40490, '<td valign="top">The motion of the clouds seems to pull me to a part of the image, though that part of the image seems relatively uninteresting (it''s away from the gazebo and into that nook on the left side of the screen, where I imagine the water bends. I wish the clouds were taking me to the man in the canoe, or the gazebo. If they were, I would have rated this higher. Nevertheless, it''s technically clean, sharp and colorful :) 6</td>', 'The motion of the clouds seems to pull me to a part of the image, though that part of the image seems relatively uninteresting (it''s away from the gazebo and into that nook on the left side of the screen, where I imagine the water bends. I wish the clouds were taking me to the man in the canoe, or the gazebo. If they were, I would have rated this higher. Nevertheless, it''s technically clean, sharp and colorful :) 6', '2009-11-29 20:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
