(5746077, 835093, 40490, '<td valign="top">interesting angle</td>', 'interesting angle', '2009-11-29 20:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746080, 835011, 40490, '<td valign="top">I like where the road takes us, and the placement of the sun seems to be designed to move the eye around the image. It accomplishes that fairly well :) 7</td>', 'I like where the road takes us, and the placement of the sun seems to be designed to move the eye around the image. It accomplishes that fairly well :) 7', '2009-11-29 20:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746081, 834955, 40490, '<td valign="top">a bit too busy :/</td>', 'a bit too busy :/', '2009-11-29 20:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746084, 835119, 40490, '<td valign="top">the colors are interesting, and the horse gives ... ... wow, I just realized how tall those trees are. Is that a pony, I hope? Either way, the fence in the background says those trees are huge!<br/> <br/>I notice grain in the image, but that''s a limitation of your camera and not your ability, so no points off for that. I''m not used to seeing a portrait-style landscape, but this came out quite nice. 7</td>', 'the colors are interesting, and the horse gives ... ... wow, I just realized how tall those trees are. Is that a pony, I hope? Either way, the fence in the background says those trees are huge! I notice grain in the image, but that''s a limitation of your camera and not your ability, so no points off for that. I''m not used to seeing a portrait-style landscape, but this came out quite nice. 7', '2009-11-29 20:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746085, 835125, 40490, '<td valign="top">the image is tilted! V_V! Remove the tilt and you would have gotten a 7... 6</td>', 'the image is tilted! V_V! Remove the tilt and you would have gotten a 7... 6', '2009-11-29 21:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746086, 835001, 40490, '<td valign="top">Striking colors! ... a bit surreal, though. either way, 7</td>', 'Striking colors! ... a bit surreal, though. either way, 7', '2009-11-29 21:00:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746087, 835123, 40490, '<td valign="top">foreground is a bit too busy</td>', 'foreground is a bit too busy', '2009-11-29 21:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746091, 834877, 40490, '<td valign="top">Immediately, I was interested in this image. The colors are great, the subject, is very nice. The photograph is clean, I like it.</td>', 'Immediately, I was interested in this image. The colors are great, the subject, is very nice. The photograph is clean, I like it.', '2009-11-29 21:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746145, 834908, 61084, '<td valign="top">I love aerial shots, but I feel this photo is hurting a little due to under exposure. Using an exposure mask on the land would have allowed you to increase the light and detail just a bit...enough to get more appreciation out of the foreground in contrast with the sun set. Good luck!</td>', 'I love aerial shots, but I feel this photo is hurting a little due to under exposure. Using an exposure mask on the land would have allowed you to increase the light and detail just a bit...enough to get more appreciation out of the foreground in contrast with the sun set. Good luck!', '2009-11-29 21:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746147, 834676, 61084, '<td valign="top">This shot looks like something that would make it into the next release of Windows at a wallpaper or background. LOL. That''s not a bad thing mind you. I love the shades of blue and the geometric patterns of the weaving mountainsides, but in all honesty I expect more out of a landscape challenge...as in more detail and more to look at. Great photo, but just not right for me in this context.</td>', 'This shot looks like something that would make it into the next release of Windows at a wallpaper or background. LOL. That''s not a bad thing mind you. I love the shades of blue and the geometric patterns of the weaving mountainsides, but in all honesty I expect more out of a landscape challenge...as in more detail and more to look at. Great photo, but just not right for me in this context.', '2009-11-29 22:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746150, 834545, 61084, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo, but where is the landscape?</td>', 'Awesome photo, but where is the landscape?', '2009-11-29 22:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746151, 835002, 61084, '<td valign="top">A great vista, but seems a little too over sharpened. With all the haze in the far background and sky I think I would have tried to darken that area using an exposure mask. A great shot though with nice bands of various colors as you go deeper into the image. Good luck!</td>', 'A great vista, but seems a little too over sharpened. With all the haze in the far background and sky I think I would have tried to darken that area using an exposure mask. A great shot though with nice bands of various colors as you go deeper into the image. Good luck!', '2009-11-29 22:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746152, 834882, 61084, '<td valign="top">Cool photo...that''s for sure, but in the context of a landscape challenge it''s not doing it for me. Good luck though!</td>', 'Cool photo...that''s for sure, but in the context of a landscape challenge it''s not doing it for me. Good luck though!', '2009-11-29 22:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746153, 835061, 61084, '<td valign="top">I love farmland shots, but this isn''t really working for me. Way too much sky in my opinion and not enough detail to see in the foreground. If this were my shot I would have brought the horizon up more to at least the bottom horizontal of the rule of thirds and maybe gotten in a little closer to the action. The clouds do look nice though and I can see why you wanted to keep more of them, but for a landscape challenge it takes away from the keep elements that we want to focus on. Just my opinion. Otherwise I do like the contrast between the blue sky, the green fields and the earth tones of the plowed fields. Good luck!</td>', 'I love farmland shots, but this isn''t really working for me. Way too much sky in my opinion and not enough detail to see in the foreground. If this were my shot I would have brought the horizon up more to at least the bottom horizontal of the rule of thirds and maybe gotten in a little closer to the action. The clouds do look nice though and I can see why you wanted to keep more of them, but for a landscape challenge it takes away from the keep elements that we want to focus on. Just my opinion. Otherwise I do like the contrast between the blue sky, the green fields and the earth tones of the plowed fields. Good luck!', '2009-11-29 22:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746154, 834851, 61084, '<td valign="top">The people in the background are distracting and this photo really doesn''t fit the landscape challenge IMO. You chose to focus on leaves and a branch rather than focus on a larger landscape area. By using a wider aperture and blurring the background it really weakens the shot. Please don''t take it as being critical because I''m just trying to give my advice. Good luck!</td>', 'The people in the background are distracting and this photo really doesn''t fit the landscape challenge IMO. You chose to focus on leaves and a branch rather than focus on a larger landscape area. By using a wider aperture and blurring the background it really weakens the shot. Please don''t take it as being critical because I''m just trying to give my advice. Good luck!', '2009-11-29 22:03:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746155, 835092, 61084, '<td valign="top">This shot would have worked a lot better had you used a smaller aperture and got more in not all of the background in focus. Being that it''s a landscape challenge you are taking the focus off that by having the foreground cow in focus and it really distracts from what''s going on in the rest of the photo. Good luck!</td>', 'This shot would have worked a lot better had you used a smaller aperture and got more in not all of the background in focus. Being that it''s a landscape challenge you are taking the focus off that by having the foreground cow in focus and it really distracts from what''s going on in the rest of the photo. Good luck!', '2009-11-29 22:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746162, 835059, 79720, '<td valign="top">Hey! Very nice, I''ve been there once or twice. I like the long exposure during daylight hours...nicely done!</td>', 'Hey! Very nice, I''ve been there once or twice. I like the long exposure during daylight hours...nicely done!', '2009-11-29 22:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746168, 835085, 79720, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Toronto Zoo? African Pavilion, perhaps?</td>', 'Interesting. Toronto Zoo? African Pavilion, perhaps?', '2009-11-29 22:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746173, 835093, 79720, '<td valign="top">Is that the CN Tower I see there? Odd perspective, I love the (HDR?) processing...the cool blue tones mellow me out.</td>', 'Is that the CN Tower I see there? Odd perspective, I love the (HDR?) processing...the cool blue tones mellow me out.', '2009-11-29 22:16:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746175, 834612, 79720, '<td valign="top">The clarity! The DoF! The sunset! The colours! The...um...border?<br/> <br/>Love this. 10 from me, even with the overbearing border.</td>', 'The clarity! The DoF! The sunset! The colours! The...um...border? Love this. 10 from me, even with the overbearing border.', '2009-11-29 22:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5746182, 834854, 18367, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning.  I only now started voting and haven''t seen the rest of the images in this challenge, but something tells me I might see this again in the winners'' circle. The very best of luck to you.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning.  I only now started voting and haven''t seen the rest of the images in this challenge, but something tells me I might see this again in the winners'' circle. The very best of luck to you.', '2009-11-29 22:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
