(5746360, 834684, 68504, '<td valign="top">One of my very few favourites in this challenge; 4th or 5th look does not disappoint.</td>', 'One of my very few favourites in this challenge; 4th or 5th look does not disappoint.', '2009-11-30 00:36:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(5746363, 835092, 83313, '<td valign="top">I''m really surprised that this placed in the low 5''s. I had it nailed for a high 5 or low 6. It got an 8 from me.</td>', 'I''m really surprised that this placed in the low 5''s. I had it nailed for a high 5 or low 6. It got an 8 from me.', '2009-11-30 00:37:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5746365, 834886, 68504, '<td valign="top">The "sticks in the water" make this photo!</td>', 'The "sticks in the water" make this photo!', '2009-11-30 00:39:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(5746367, 834648, 52549, '<td valign="top">Knew this would ribbon, it''s just too stunning for words. Excellent work, John. Congratulations on the yellow.</td>', 'Knew this would ribbon, it''s just too stunning for words. Excellent work, John. Congratulations on the yellow.', '2009-11-30 00:41:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(5746370, 834751, 83313, '<td valign="top">Now that I see what camera this was shot with, I see my comment was spot on. This is an example of a situation where better equipment would have made a difference. If you were shooting RAW with an SLR, you would have been able to recover some of that shadow detail without the artifacts. I gave it a 6 because of what you did accomplish with what you had.<br/> <br/>I was also shooting JPEG with a similar camera at the same time of day. I was shooting away from the sun, however, and also did a 3 exposure HDR merge to compensate for the narrower dynamic range of the JPG format.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-11-30 00:43:40.</i></td>', 'Now that I see what camera this was shot with, I see my comment was spot on. This is an example of a situation where better equipment would have made a difference. If you were shooting RAW with an SLR, you would have been able to recover some of that shadow detail without the artifacts. I gave it a 6 because of what you did accomplish with what you had. I was also shooting JPEG with a similar camera at the same time of day. I was shooting away from the sun, however, and also did a 3 exposure HDR merge to compensate for the narrower dynamic range of the JPG format.', '2009-11-30 00:42:26.000000', '2009-11-30 00:43:40.000000', 0),
(5746372, 834612, 52549, '<td valign="top">Many congrats on your ribbon, Tareq. Love this beauty (even the border ;-)</td>', 'Many congrats on your ribbon, Tareq. Love this beauty (even the border ;-)', '2009-11-30 00:44:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(5746376, 834683, 52549, '<td valign="top">Huge congrats on your win and the fantastic score. Wonderful image.</td>', 'Huge congrats on your win and the fantastic score. Wonderful image.', '2009-11-30 00:46:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(5746380, 834579, 68504, '<td valign="top">This speaks to me. All the magic in the ordinary.</td>', 'This speaks to me. All the magic in the ordinary.', '2009-11-30 00:48:32.000000', NULL, 0),
