(5746551, 835094, 65234, '<td valign="top">A paper towel?!  A plain old paper towel and some wrapping paper and a flashlight made this?!!!  The landscape you created in my mind had wonderful light, rich color, and just a hint of Hell in the movement.  I envisioned disoriented souls in a long line on the left, just out of camera range, marching invitably toward their eternal punishment.  One of us has too much imagination ;-)</td>', 'A paper towel?!  A plain old paper towel and some wrapping paper and a flashlight made this?!!!  The landscape you created in my mind had wonderful light, rich color, and just a hint of Hell in the movement.  I envisioned disoriented souls in a long line on the left, just out of camera range, marching invitably toward their eternal punishment.  One of us has too much imagination ;-)', '2009-11-30 07:27:02.000000', NULL, 0),
