(5747061, 834907, 23439, '<td valign="top">After reading your notes I see what you saw with the "monster". That said to me the image has too much featureless blue to it. The first outtake picture you listed though I Really like. Maybe if the monster was lower in the image it would draw more attention to it. Maybe cropped right above the foreground bush.</td>', 'After reading your notes I see what you saw with the "monster". That said to me the image has too much featureless blue to it. The first outtake picture you listed though I Really like. Maybe if the monster was lower in the image it would draw more attention to it. Maybe cropped right above the foreground bush.', '2009-11-30 16:13:53.000000', NULL, 0),
