(5747732, 835107, 29011, '<td valign="top">This made my top10 list of pics. As I was looking I had a feeling the colors were intended to be be shown as such, and I liked it. It''s not over the top. Reminds me of those velvia shots. Composition wise, it also strikes a nice balance. If some monitors are set to a too high contrast setting it might look oversatured there? with those folks who voted a 4 ;)</td>', 'This made my top10 list of pics. As I was looking I had a feeling the colors were intended to be be shown as such, and I liked it. It''s not over the top. Reminds me of those velvia shots. Composition wise, it also strikes a nice balance. If some monitors are set to a too high contrast setting it might look oversatured there? with those folks who voted a 4 ;)', '2009-12-01 01:07:16.000000', NULL, 0),
