(5759628, 835107, 30982, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition.  And lately I''ve been enjoying the almost over-the-top colors on some color photographs - the colors do work here.  Mostly, though, I love those little twists of grass in the foreground - if I reach out, I can feel them!</td>', 'Excellent composition.  And lately I''ve been enjoying the almost over-the-top colors on some color photographs - the colors do work here.  Mostly, though, I love those little twists of grass in the foreground - if I reach out, I can feel them!', '2009-12-08 04:10:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(5760352, 834555, 112107, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Ja-9:</b></div><hr/><i> I really like this...which bridge is it and where is it??? </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I''m sure it''s the Vasco da Gama bridge (the second Tagus river crossing in Lisbon).<br/>This is currently the longest bridge in Europe with a little over 17km.<br/>Search wikipedia for <b>Vasco_da_Gama_Bridge</b>.<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Ja-9: I really like this...which bridge is it and where is it???  I''m sure it''s the Vasco da Gama bridge (the second Tagus river crossing in Lisbon).This is currently the longest bridge in Europe with a little over 17km.Search wikipedia for Vasco_da_Gama_Bridge.', '2009-12-08 19:13:53.000000', NULL, 0),
